#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:5
#: 898afaf0b94d449390a55ebb6c4e5a7a
msgid "Choosing a Ground Station"
msgstr "选择地面站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:7
#: 6e45bd25e5de4187a6698f5f36597b1b
msgid ""
"This page gives a high-level overview of the available Ground Control "
"Stations (GCS) and provides links so you can make the appropriate choice."
msgstr "本页概述了可用的地面控制站（GCS）并提供相关链接，以帮助您做出合适的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:12
#: a40752b19d2b451990026c05486035b0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:14
#: 6022e490ff4b4e3dab7fc42647f2bbdd
msgid ""
"A ground station is typically a software application, running on a ground-"
"based computer,phone,or transmitter, that communicates with your UAV via "
":ref:`wireless telemetry <common-telemetry-landingpage>` or USB cable. It "
"displays real-time data on the UAVs performance and position and can serve "
"as a “virtual cockpit”, showing many of the same instruments that you would "
"have if you were flying a real plane. A GCS can also be used to control a "
"UAV in flight, uploading new mission commands and setting parameters. It is "
"often also used to monitor the live video streams from a UAV’s cameras."
msgstr ""
"地面站通常是运行在地面计算机、手机或遥控器上的软件应用程序，通过 :ref:`无线数传 <common-telemetry-landingpage>` "
"或 USB 线缆与无人机通信。它实时显示无人机的飞行数据和位置，并可作为「虚拟驾驶舱」，显示许多与真实飞机相同的仪表。GCS "
"还可用于在飞行中控制无人机、上传新任务命令和设置参数，通常也用于监控无人机摄像头的实时视频画面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:22
#: accde0870f4e4941b0bc1af0d65ff47b
msgid ""
"A GCS is also required to setup the configuration of the autopilot prior to "
"its use and to update the autopilot's firmware."
msgstr "GCS 还需用于使用前的飞控配置和固件更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:24
#: ad0b6b59a06b46cc95ec0cd9fed5adf6
msgid ""
"There are at least ten different ground control stations. On desktop there "
"is *Mission Planner*, *APM Planner 2*, *MAVProxy*, *QGroundControl*, *UgCS*,"
" and *LOGOS*. For Tablet/Smartphone there are *QGroundControl*, *Tower* "
"(DroidPlanner 3), *MAVPilot*, *AndroPilot* and *SidePilot* that can be used "
"to communicate with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"目前至少有十种不同的地面控制站。桌面端有 *Mission Planner*、*APM Planner "
"2*、*MAVProxy*、*QGroundControl*、*UgCS* 和 *LOGOS*。平板/智能手机端有 "
"*QGroundControl*、*Tower*（DroidPlanner 3）、*MAVPilot*、*AndroPilot* 和 "
"*SidePilot*，可与 ArduPilot 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:29
#: 6deb5205cf6443288604d74782eb76fa
msgid ""
"The decision to select a particular GCS often depends on your vehicle and "
"preferred computing platform:"
msgstr "选择特定 GCS 通常取决于您的飞行器和偏好的计算平台："

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:32
#: 4b99c82c6e3644c7854aa8216f89bb5c
msgid ""
"**Ready-to-fly** users may prefer the portability and ease of use of "
"*QGroundControl*, or another GCS running on a tablet or phone."
msgstr "**即飞型** 用户可能更喜欢 *QGroundControl* 或其他在平板/手机上运行的 GCS 的便携性和易用性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:35
#: c4fd86f8c68a40a0b5a7e3c9e2ee9e1f
msgid ""
"**DIY/Kit** users and developers often have to access configuration and "
"analysis tools, and would therefore need (at least initially) *Mission "
"Planner*, *QGroundControl*, *APM Planner 2* or another more full-featured "
"GCS."
msgstr ""
"**DIY/套件** 用户和开发者通常需要访问配置和分析工具，因此需要（至少初期）使用 *Mission "
"Planner*、*QGroundControl*、*APM Planner 2* 或其他功能更完善的 GCS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:38
#: 93a5de63d0aa4077b2d364de2e1db831
msgid "**Code Developers** will appreciate some of *MAVProxy's* features."
msgstr "**代码开发者** 会欣赏 *MAVProxy* 的某些功能。"

