msgid "UgCS - Universal Ground Control Station"
msgstr "UgCS - 通用地面控制站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:117
#: bad55b71a4fb48ba87816f5c0eaa242b
msgid ""
"Universal and easy to use ground control station with a 3D interface. "
"Supports APM, Pixhawk as well as drones from other manufacturers such as "
"DJI, Mikrokopter and more. Intended for enthusiasts as well as professional "
"users."
msgstr ""
"通用且易于使用的地面控制站，具有 3D 界面。支持 APM、Pixhawk 以及 DJI、Mikrokopter "
"等其他厂商的无人机，适合爱好者和专业用户使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:121
#: 05c3eb3fe4844a0298eac684ec717c98
msgid ""
"It is capable of communicating with and controlling multiple drones "
"simultaneously."
msgstr "能够同时与多架无人机通信和控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:123
#: 86c15fe8a1d84c93b598f6bbce4ac476
msgid ""
"UgCS supports multiple map layers as well as different map providers. Some "
"of the features of UgCS include - DEM Import, ADS-B transponder and receiver"
" support, Click & Go mode, Joystick mode, image geotagging and video "
"recording. UgCS also comes with a telemetry player, allowing the replay of "
"all flights."
msgstr ""
"UgCS 支持多地图图层和不同地图提供商。功能包括 DEM 导入、ADS-B "
"应答器和接收器支持、点击飞行模式、摇杆模式、图像地理标记和视频录制。UgCS 还附带数传播放器，可回放所有飞行记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:125
#: 77a7e88e2c984b2aa08c3afda1b0313c
msgid ""
"UgCS comes with in-built no-fly zones around all major airports as well as "
"the ability to create custom no-fly zones."
msgstr "UgCS 内置主要机场周边禁飞区，并支持创建自定义禁飞区。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-choosing-a-ground-station.rst:127
#: 61131eb1aa204a97a903ed3ace86d973
msgid ""
"Supports multi-node installation, meaning that it is possible to connect "
"multiple pilots with UgCS laptops in the field to a central ground control "
"server."
msgstr "支持多节点安装，即可将多名飞手的 UgCS 笔记本电脑在现场连接到中央地面控制服务器。"

