msgid ""
"Tower (a.k.a. \"DroidPlanner 3\") is an Android GCS for phones and tablets. "
"It is intended for end users and enthusiasts, and includes features like "
"follow-me, “dronies” (i.e. “selfies” but taken with a drone) and special "
"missions for 3D mapping."
msgstr ""
"Tower（又名「DroidPlanner 3」）是适用于手机和平板的 Android "
"GCS，面向终端用户和爱好者，功能包括跟随飞行、「无人机自拍」以及用于 3D 建图的特殊任务。"

